{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pulls/2596","id":3546752316,"node_id":"PR_kwDOM2nIG87TZyU8","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2596","diff_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2596.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2596.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/issues/2596","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pulls/2596/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pulls/2596/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/issues/2596/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/statuses/de05e1ef49113bb46592a6446fbafdb5830c87c8","number":2596,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"SEP-2596: Specification Feature Lifecycle and Deprecation Policy","user":{"login":"localden","id":53200638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjAwNjM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53200638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden","html_url":"https://github.com/localden","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/localden/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Establishes a formal lifecycle for individual features within the MCP specification (Active, Deprecated, Removed), with a minimum twelve-month window between deprecation and earliest removal, required `@deprecated` schema annotations and changelog entries, and a two-SEP procedure where deprecation and removal are each their own proposal.\n\nThis is the mechanics follow-up to the direction recorded in the [April 1, 2026 Core Maintainer meeting](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/discussions/2536) (\"formal versioning status and SDK deprecation cycle: direction agreed, mechanics TBD\") and the support-window model floated at the [NYC maintainer meeting](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/discussions/2547). It reclassifies the two existing informal deprecations (the HTTP+SSE transport and the `includeContext` values `thisServer`/`allServers`) under the new policy and notes its relationship to SEP-1400 (semantic versioning) as complementary rather than overlapping.","labels":[{"id":8912181741,"node_id":"LA_kwDOM2nIG88AAAACEzUZ7Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/labels/SEP","name":"SEP","description":"","color":"ee6cb9","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8943617642,"node_id":"LA_kwDOM2nIG88AAAACFRTGag","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/labels/final","name":"final","description":"SEP finalized.","color":"4e0bd0","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15008729,"node_id":"MI_kwDOM2nIG84A5QPZ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/milestones/4","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/milestone/4","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontext